   "subject": "How to plot bar chart with data table",
   "parts": [
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi,<br>Is it possible to plot similar chart as below? bar chart with data table, show the legend in the table.<br><img alt=\"\"><br>\r\n<br><br> I used geom_bar, geom_line,geom_point and facet_grid...but how to plot the data table, show two Y axis, adjust the point color?<br><br></div><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:15px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\">\r\n<span style=\"white-space:pre;color:blue\"> </span><span style=\"color:blue\">library(ggplot2)</span></pre></span><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:15px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\">\r\n<span style=\"white-space:pre;color:blue\"> </span><span style=\"color:blue\">df.test &lt;- data.frame(Group=c(rep(&#39;A&#39;,5),rep(&#39;B&#39;,4)),Time=c(paste(&quot;WW&quot;,c(1:5,1,2,4,5),sep=&quot;&quot;)))</span></pre>\r\n</span><br><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:15px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\">\r\n<span style=\"color:blue\">df.test1 &lt;- df.test\r\n</span><span style=\"white-space:pre;color:blue\"></span><span style=\"color:blue\">df.test2 &lt;- df.test\r\n</span><span style=\"white-space:pre;color:blue\"></span><span style=\"color:blue\">df.test3 &lt;- df.test\r\n</span><span style=\"white-space:pre;color:blue\"></span><span style=\"color:blue\">df.test1$Data &lt;- 1:9\r\n</span><span style=\"white-space:pre;color:blue\"></span><span style=\"color:blue\">df.test1$Class &lt;- &quot;data1&quot;\r\n</span><span style=\"white-space:pre;color:blue\"></span><span style=\"color:blue\">df.test2$Data &lt;- 2:10\r\n</span><span style=\"white-space:pre;color:blue\"></span><span style=\"color:blue\">df.test2$Class &lt;- &quot;data2&quot;\r\n</span><span style=\"white-space:pre;color:blue\"></span><span style=\"color:blue\">df.test3$Sum &lt;- 3:11\r\n</span><span style=\"white-space:pre;color:blue\"></span><span style=\"color:blue\">df.test &lt;- rbind(df.test1,df.test2)<br></span><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:15px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\">\r\n<span style=\"white-space:pre;color:blue\"> </span><span style=\"color:blue\">df.test &lt;- merge(df.test,df.test3)<br></span><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:15px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\">\r\n<span style=\"white-space:pre;color:blue\"> </span><span style=\"color:blue\">df.test\r\n</span>   Group Time Data Class Sum\r\n1      A  WW1    1 data1   3\r\n2      A  WW1    2 data2   3\r\n3      A  WW2    3 data2   4\r\n4      A  WW2    2 data1   4\r\n5      A  WW3    4 data2   5\r\n6      A  WW3    3 data1   5\r\n7      A  WW4    5 data2   6\r\n8      A  WW4    4 data1   6\r\n9      A  WW5    5 data1   7\r\n10     A  WW5    6 data2   7\r\n11     B  WW1    7 data2   8\r\n12     B  WW1    6 data1   8\r\n13     B  WW2    8 data2   9\r\n14     B  WW2    7 data1   9\r\n15     B  WW4    9 data2  10\r\n16     B  WW4    8 data1  10\r\n17     B  WW5    9 data1  11\r\n18     B  WW5   10 data2  11\r\n<br><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:15px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\">\r\n<span style=\"color:blue\">p &lt;- ggplot(data=df.test,aes(x=Time,y=Data,fill=factor(Class)))\r\n</span><span style=\"white-space:pre;color:blue\"></span><span style=\"color:blue\">p+geom_bar(position=&#39;stack&#39;,stat=&quot;identity&quot;)+geom_line(aes(x=Time,y=Sum,group=Group),colour=&quot;green&quot;,size=2,linetype=1)+geom_point(aes(x=Time,y=Sum,group=Group),colour=&quot;green&quot;,size=5,shape=23)+facet_grid(~Group)</span></pre>\r\n</span><span style=\"white-space:pre;color:blue\"></span><span style=\"color:blue\"></span></pre></span><br><img alt=\"\"><br>\r\n</pre></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\">\r\nThanks!<br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\">\r\nTina<br><br></pre></span></div>\r\n"
    ]
